column101:
04/Jul/10 11:06 AM;557058:3785a99a-fc51-48ca-849f-1bb76dd2deb1;Message from lim: 

i just was reading a story on ao3 and i remembered someone had asked me about the stats
line and then various things happened in RL and i didn't commit it
	
it would take me ages to get set up right now, but the stats line is probably a quick
fix, assuming the floats self clear in ie7
	
so replace the meta block with this or something along these lines
 	
in site-chrome.css


/* META*/
 #main dl.meta 				{ background: #fffef9; border: 2px solid; clear: right; margin:
0 auto; padding: 0.5em; position: relative }
 .meta dt, .meta dt.warning	{ font-size: 0.875em; font-weight: 100; width: 10.5em }
 #main .meta dd				{ margin: -1.3em 0 .7em 13em;  }
 #main .meta .stats dl dd,  #main .meta .stats dl dt	{ margin: 0 0.5em 0; width:auto;
float:left}
 #main .meta dd.stats:after {color:#fffef9; font-size:1.5em; content:"."}
 .meta dd ul li 			{ display: inline; margin: auto;}
 .meta dd blockquote		{ margin: -1em 0 0 0 !important;}

 	
to quickly explain that for whoever is on front end
 	
i floated the dd and dt inside the stats dd and gave them a width of auto, removing
the 10.5em fixed width they were inheriting

 #main .meta .stats dl dd,  #main .meta .stats dl dt	{ margin: 0 0.5em 0; width:auto;
float:left}


and then to bring down the enclosing container so we don't get text breaking out, i've
inserted a full stop "." of size 1.5em and made it the same colour as the background
so you can't see it on the page and placed that after the stats dd
 	
	
:after pseudo classes are css3, but I am assuming that ie7 will incorrectly expand
to enclose the floats anyway, and so doesn't need the rule
	
if ie7 does not, for some unforseen reason, enclose the float, then you will have to
bodge in the xhtml structure for now
 	
in this case in the xhtml structure in the dd class="stats", insert

<div class="clear"><!--presentational--></div>
 	
ok, i hope that covers any questions or problems and I'm sorry I didn't do that earlier

