to normal!

Steps:

1) views/home/index.html.erb
change image tag back to: 

image_tag('logo.png', :alt => ArchiveConfig.APP_NAME + ' logo', :class => 'logo', :height=>
'70', :width => '105')

2) public/stylesheets/home.css 
change definition of ".titles" back to:

.titles {
padding-left: 110px;
margin-bottom: -0.5em;
margin-right: 13.75em;
min-height: 70px;
}
